# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Alaminn.info — Environment template
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#
# Canonical env file: .env.config (preferred) or .env.config.local.
# Copy this file to .env.config and replace every placeholder with real values.
# NEVER commit real values.
#
# Legacy .env / .env.local are supported only as fallback with a deprecation
# warning when .env.config is absent. Do not use .env as the canonical file.
#
# Generate JWT_SECRET with:      openssl rand -hex 32
# Generate SESSION_SECRET with:  openssl rand -hex 32
# Generate CRON_SECRET with:     openssl rand -hex 32
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── Core ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development
# ⚠ SQLite path resolution: the Prisma CLI resolves relative paths against
# prisma/, while the standalone Next server resolves them against its own
# CWD — a relative path can silently create an EMPTY database under
# `output: "standalone"`. For SQLite, use an ABSOLUTE path:
#   DATABASE_URL="file:/absolute/path/to/alaminn.info/db/custom.db"
# Production (MariaDB): DATABASE_URL="mysql://user:pass@host:3306/db"
DATABASE_URL="file:./db/custom.db"
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# ─── Auth ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
JWT_SECRET="<REPLACE_WITH_openssl_rand_hex_32>"
# AUTH_SECRET is a legacy alias; prefer JWT_SECRET.
# (NEXTAUTH_URL is legacy — the platform uses its own JWT session, not next-auth.)

# ─── Admin bootstrap (used by prisma/seed.ts only) ─────────────────
ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_EMAIL="admin@alaminn.info"
ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD="<REPLACE_WITH_A_STRONG_PASSWORD_12+_CHARS>"

# ─── Cron / scheduled tasks ─────────────────────────────────────────
CRON_SECRET="<REPLACE_WITH_openssl_rand_hex_32>"

# ─── Email (SMTP OR Resend — pick one) ──────────────────────────────
EMAIL_FROM="noreply@alaminn.info"
EMAIL_REPLY_TO="hello@alaminn.info"
# Option A: SMTP
SMTP_HOST=""
SMTP_PORT="587"
SMTP_USER=""
SMTP_PASS=""
# Option B: Resend (alternative to SMTP)
RESEND_API_KEY=""

# ─── WhatsApp Cloud API (Meta) ──────────────────────────────────────
WHATSAPP_NUMBER="01716609554"                         # Local format
WHATSAPP_INTERNATIONAL_NUMBER="8801716609554"         # No '+', no spaces
WHATSAPP_DISPLAY_NUMBER="01716 609 554"
WHATSAPP_BUSINESS_NAME="Al Aminn"
WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN="<REPLACE_WITH_random_string>"
WHATSAPP_API_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=""                      # Meta Cloud API Phone Number ID
WHATSAPP_API_TOKEN=""                                # Meta Cloud API access token

# ─── WhatsApp AI Agent ──────────────────────────────────────────────
WHATSAPP_AI_MODE="dev"                                # dev | live
WHATSAPP_AI_PROVIDER="unorouter"                      # unorouter | groq | gemini | zai
WHATSAPP_AI_MODEL="claude-opus-4-6-thinking"

# ─── ALO Education referral signing (HMAC) ─────────────────────────
HIGHER_STUDY_REFERRAL_SECRET="<REPLACE_WITH_openssl_rand_hex_32>"
ENGLISH_LEARNING_REFERRAL_SECRET="<REPLACE_WITH_openssl_rand_hex_32>"

# ─── Logging ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
LOG_LEVEL="info"                                     # error | warn | info | debug

# ─── Backup retention (deploy/backup-sqlite.sh, scripts/release-backup.mjs) ─
BACKUP_RETENTION_COUNT="14"                           # Number of backup archives to keep
BACKUP_VERIFY_DATABASE_URL=""                         # scratch DB URL used to restore-verify release backups

# ─── Mini-service: audit-worker (optional, separate DB URL) ────────
AGENTOS_DATABASE_URL=""

# ─── Social Command Center (Meta) ───────────────────────────────────
META_APP_SECRET=""                                    # Webhook HMAC verification (fail-closed in prod)
META_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN=""                          # Falls back to WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN
# Per-account Page/IG tokens are entered in /admin/social/accounts and stored AES-256-GCM encrypted in DB — not in env.

# ─── Multi-Provider AI Router (UnoRouter Primary + 100% Free AI Fallback Stack) ─
# Configure here OR live inside `/admin/ai-agents` -> AI Providers tab (stored AES-256-GCM encrypted in DB).
FREE_AI_PREFERRED_PROVIDER="unorouter"                # unorouter | auto | groq | gemini | cerebras | openrouter | github | cloudflare | sambanova | zhipu | mistral | huggingface | pollinations | ollama | local-grounded
AI_PREFERRED_PROVIDER="unorouter"                     # Alias for FREE_AI_PREFERRED_PROVIDER
UNOROUTER_API_KEY=""                                  # https://unorouter.com (Primary preferred OpenAI-compatible gateway — claude-opus-4-6-thinking)
UNOROUTER_BASE_URL="https://api.unorouter.com/v1"     # Base URL for https://api.unorouter.com/v1/chat/completions
GROQ_API_KEY=""                                       # https://console.groq.com (14,400 RPD free, no credit card)
GEMINI_API_KEY=""                                     # https://aistudio.google.com/apikey (Gemini 2.5 Flash + text-embedding-004 free)
GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY=""                                  # Optional alias for GEMINI_API_KEY
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=""                                   # https://cloud.cerebras.ai (1M tokens/day free, no credit card)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=""                                 # https://openrouter.ai/keys (:free models aggregator)
GITHUB_MODELS_TOKEN=""                                # https://github.com/settings/tokens (GPT-4.1-mini / DeepSeek-R1 free)
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=""                               # https://dash.cloudflare.com (10,000 neurons/day free)
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=""                              # Cloudflare 32-char Account ID
SAMBANOVA_API_KEY=""                                  # https://cloud.sambanova.ai
CHUTES_API_KEY=""                                     # https://chutes.ai
ZHIPU_API_KEY=""                                      # https://open.bigmodel.cn (GLM-4.5-Flash unlimited free)
MODELSCOPE_API_KEY=""                                 # https://modelscope.cn (2,000 req/day free)
SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=""                                # https://cloud.siliconflow.cn
MISTRAL_API_KEY=""                                    # https://console.mistral.ai
NVIDIA_API_KEY=""                                     # https://build.nvidia.com
HF_TOKEN=""                                           # https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
OLLAMA_BASE_URL="http://localhost:11434/v1"           # Local Ollama (enabled when OLLAMA_ENABLED="true" or toggled in UI)
OLLAMA_ENABLED="false"

# ── Ollama Cloud (PAID — https://ollama.com/api) ─────────────────────
# Per spec: Ollama Cloud is a separate, paid cloud provider. Configured
# independently from local Ollama. Check current plan limits + pricing at
# https://ollama.com before enabling. Usage is tracked for cost control.
OLLAMA_CLOUD_ENABLED="false"                          # Set to "true" to enable Ollama Cloud
OLLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY=""                               # Required when OLLAMA_CLOUD_ENABLED="true"
OLLAMA_CLOUD_BASE_URL="https://ollama.com/api"        # Override only for testing
OLLAMA_CLOUD_TIMEOUT_MS="30000"                       # Request timeout (default 30s)
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MAX_RETRIES="2"                          # Max retries on 429/5xx (default 2)

# Optional: per-agent model selection. If not set, agents use their tier default.
# Discover available models via the admin UI or GET /api/v1/admin/ai-provider/ollama-cloud/models
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_SEO=""
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_CONTENT=""
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_WHATSAPP=""
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_SMS=""
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_LEAD_QUALIFICATION=""
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_CRM=""

# Optional Free Search & Tool Keys (Wikipedia, Open-Meteo, OpenAlex, Pollinations FLUX require NO key)
TAVILY_API_KEY=""                                     # https://tavily.com (1,000 searches/month free)
BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=""                               # https://brave.com/search/api (2,000 queries/month free)


# ─── ALO Education staff auth + UCI/UMC (grafted subsystem) ─────────
# Session signing secret for staff dashboards (/login,/dashboard,/console,
# /reports,/settings,/admin/uci) — use a distinct 32+ byte secret:
SESSION_SECRET="replace-with-openssl-rand-hex-32"

# Universal Messaging Channel service (mini-services/messaging-channel):
UMC_SERVICE_URL="http://127.0.0.1:3010"


# ─── OWNER bootstrap (scripts/seed-admin.ts — alternative to prisma/seed.ts) ─
ADMIN_EMAIL="owner@alaminn.info"                      # Login email for the seeded OWNER
ADMIN_NAME="Al Aminn"                                 # Display name
ADMIN_PASSWORD=""                                     # REQUIRED by seed-admin.ts — strong password, 12+ chars

# ─── AgentOS audit worker (scripts/agentos-worker.ts) ───────────────
AGENTOS_DATABASE_URL=""                               # REQUIRED by the worker: absolute file: path (e.g. file:/abs/path/db/agentos.db)
AGENTOS_AUDIT_SECRET=""                               # REQUIRED: 32-byte hex (openssl rand -hex 32) — signs audit events

# ─── ALO Education UCI seed corpus (scripts/seed_uci.ts) ────────────
ALO_DATASET="/home/z/my-project/scripts/audit/alo_dataset.json"  # Path to the dataset JSON

# ─── Audit log pruning (src/app/api/cron/audit-log-prune) ──────────
AUDIT_LOG_RETENTION_DAYS="365"                        # Older audit events are pruned by the cron

# ─── Free AI provider fallback keys (src/lib/ai/free-providers.ts) ─
JINA_API_KEY=""                                       # Jina reader/embeddings fallback
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=""                                 # TTS fallback voice provider


# ─── Social webhook HMAC fallback (src/app/api/v1/social/webhooks/[platform]) ─
WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET=""                                # Used only when META_APP_SECRET is unset

# ─── Automated security suite (scripts/security-tests.ts) ───────────
SECURITY_TEST_BASE="http://127.0.0.1:3001"            # CI overrides to http://localhost:3000

# NOTE: NEXT_RUNTIME is set internally by Next.js (nodejs|edge) — do not configure manually.

# ─── Ecosystem API bridge (src/lib/ecosystem/gateway.ts) ──────────────
ALAMINN_ECOSYSTEM_API_KEY=""                         # Bootstrap key for the self-hosted AI-OS services (Activepieces, Directus, NocoBase, Temporal) to call /api/v1/ecosystem/* — min 32 chars (openssl rand -hex 32); blank disables the env-key path (per-client ApiKeys from /admin/api-platform still work)

# ─── AEO citation tracking (src/lib/aeo/tracker.ts) ────────────────────
# Reuses BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY (documented above in "Free Search & Tool Keys")
# for REAL answer-engine citation checks — blank = runs record provider_unavailable,
# never a simulated score.

# ─── Email failover providers (src/lib/email/providers.ts) ──────────
# EMAIL_PREFERRED_PROVIDER="resend"                     # resend | smtp | sparkpost | sendgrid | mailgun | mailjet | sendinblue | sendpulse | pepipost | elasticemail
# EMAIL_FALLBACK_ORDER="resend,smtp"                    # optional explicit failover order
# EMAIL_SPARKPOST_API_KEY=""                            # Per-provider keys below are optional —
# EMAIL_SPARKPOST_FROM=""                               # only needed when you route that provider.
# EMAIL_SENDGRID_API_KEY=""
# EMAIL_SENDGRID_FROM=""
# EMAIL_MAILGUN_API_KEY=""
# EMAIL_MAILGUN_DOMAIN=""
# EMAIL_MAILGUN_FROM=""
# EMAIL_MAILJET_API_KEY=""
# EMAIL_MAILJET_SECRET_KEY=""
# EMAIL_MAILJET_FROM=""
# EMAIL_SENDINBLUE_API_KEY=""
# EMAIL_SENDINBLUE_FROM=""
# EMAIL_SENDPULSE_CLIENT_ID=""
# EMAIL_SENDPULSE_CLIENT_SECRET=""
# EMAIL_SENDPULSE_FROM=""
# EMAIL_PEPIPOST_API_KEY=""
# EMAIL_PEPIPOST_FROM=""
# EMAIL_ELASTICEMAIL_API_KEY=""
# EMAIL_ELASTICEMAIL_FROM=""

# ─── SMS failover providers (src/lib/sms/providers.ts, src/lib/env.ts) ─
# SMS_PREFERRED_PROVIDER="httpsms"                      # httpsms | textbelt | twilio | plivo
# SMS_FALLBACK_ORDER="httpsms,textbelt"                 # optional explicit failover order
# SMS_HTTPSMS_API_KEY=""
# SMS_HTTPSMS_BASE_URL=""                               # default https://api.httpsms.com
# SMS_HTTPSMS_FROM=""
# SMS_TEXTBELT_KEY=""                                   # TEXTBELT = free daily tier
# SMS_TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=""
# SMS_TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=""
# SMS_TWILIO_FROM=""
# SMS_PLIVO_AUTH_ID=""
# SMS_PLIVO_AUTH_TOKEN=""
# SMS_PLIVO_FROM=""

# ─── Staff bootstrap (scripts/bootstrap-staff.ts — first admin account) ─
# REQUIRED for provisioning; CI sets these per-run (see .github/workflows/ci.yml).
# STAFF_BOOTSTRAP_EMAIL="owner@alaminn.info"
# STAFF_BOOTSTRAP_NAME="Site Owner"
# STAFF_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD=""                           # REQUIRED — strong password, 14+ chars

# ─── Misc runtime settings ───────────────────────────────────────────
RESET_CODE_RETENTION_HOURS="24"                       # session-cleanup cron: retention for used reset codes (0 = immediate)
ALO_AUDIT_DATASET_PATH=""                             # /api/v1/uci/audit dataset override (defaults to ALO_DATASET)
NEXT_PUBLIC_LINKEDIN_URL=""                           # Public LinkedIn profile used by the endorsements page

# NOTE: WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_SECRET overrides WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET/META_APP_SECRET for
# WhatsApp webhook HMAC verification (src/app/api/v1/whatsapp/webhook/route.ts).
